{"n":8,"file":"p08.mp3","duration":39.880001068115234,"text":"\"I never thought of that,\" said the very old man, \"What shall we do?\" The very old woman thought for a while and then she said, \"I know! We will let the cats decide which one we should keep.\" \"Oh yes,\" said the very old man, and he called to the cats, \"Which one of you is the prettiest?\" \"I am!\" \"I am!\" \"No, I am!\" \"No, I am the prettiest!\" \"I am!\" \"No, I am! I am! I am!\" cried hundreds and thousands and millions and billions and trillions of voices, for each cat thought itself the prettiest.","lines":[{"i":0,"c":0,"len":69,"t":0.0,"t1":5.300000190734863},{"i":1,"c":70,"len":121,"t":5.760000228881836,"t1":14.119999885559082},{"i":2,"c":192,"len":96,"t":14.960000038146973,"t1":21.860000610351562},{"i":3,"c":289,"len":208,"t":22.399999618530273,"t1":38.91999816894531}],"words":[{"c":1,"t":0.0,"t1":0.28},{"c":3,"t":0.28,"t1":0.84},{"c":9,"t":0.84,"t1":1.42},{"c":17,"t":1.42,"t1":1.6},{"c":20,"t":1.6,"t1":2.02},{"c":27,"t":2.48,"t1":2.5},{"c":32,"t":2.5,"t1":2.7},{"c":36,"t":2.7,"t1":3.06},{"c":41,"t":3.06,"t1":3.34},{"c":45,"t":3.34,"t1":3.66},{"c":51,"t":4.44,"t1":4.56},{"c":56,"t":4.56,"t1":4.78},{"c":62,"t":4.78,"t1":4.98},{"c":65,"t":4.98,"t1":5.3},{"c":70,"t":5.76,"t1":5.9},{"c":74,"t":5.9,"t1":6.28},{"c":79,"t":6.28,"t1":6.72},{"c":83,"t":6.72,"t1":6.98},{"c":89,"t":6.98,"t1":7.34},{"c":97,"t":7.34,"t1":7.7},{"c":101,"t":7.7,"t1":7.88},{"c":103,"t":7.88,"t1":8.02},{"c":109,"t":8.32,"t1":8.7},{"c":113,"t":8.7,"t1":9.0},{"c":118,"t":9.0,"t1":9.28},{"c":122,"t":9.28,"t1":9.52},{"c":129,"t":10.08,"t1":10.32},{"c":131,"t":10.32,"t1":10.62},{"c":137,"t":10.84,"t1":11.28},{"c":140,"t":11.28,"t1":11.46},{"c":145,"t":11.46,"t1":11.64},{"c":149,"t":11.64,"t1":12.3},{"c":153,"t":12.3,"t1":12.3},{"c":158,"t":12.3,"t1":12.86},{"c":165,"t":12.86,"t1":13.18},{"c":171,"t":13.18,"t1":13.38},{"c":175,"t":13.38,"t1":13.6},{"c":178,"t":13.6,"t1":13.82},{"c":185,"t":13.82,"t1":14.12},{"c":193,"t":14.9